OL,3,GNEWSATwo sentenced in #266m gold money
OL,4,Alaundering plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth were found guilty of money
OL,7,Flaundering and at Leeds Crown Court on
OL,8,FFriday Haider, of Bob Marley Way,
OL,9,FLambeth, was jailed for six years and
OL,10,FRivers, of Hazelwood Drive, Leeds, was
OL,11,Fjailed for 27 months, suspended for two
OL,12,Fyears.
